<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to tender for 54,000T U.S. corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to tender for 54,000T U.S. corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's FGEP corn buying group will tender on Wednesday for a shipment of 54,000 tonnes of U.S. No.2 corn, traders said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The FGEP group comprises Fwu Sow Grain, Great Wall Enterprise, President Enterprise, Ever Smile Feed Mill Co and Fong Yu.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>		     U.S. Gulf	   Pacific N.W.</p>
<p>   One    54,000 September 1-15    September 16-30</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
